    "html": "<p>The four energy states for an atom are shown.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the lowest frequency of radiation that can be absorbed by the atom?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{E_{1}-E_{4}}{h}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{E_{4}-E_{1}}{h}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{E_{3}-E_{4}}{h}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{E_{4}-E_{3}}{h}\"></span></li></ol>"
